# Local developer scratch. `_temp/` holds the owner's own ProPresenter exports,
# which carry copyrighted worship lyrics and must never be committed — the
# committed test fixtures are LYRIC-SANITISED derivatives produced from them by
# tools/pp7-sanitise-fixture.js (see tests/fixtures/propresenter/README.md).
#
# The trailing slash makes this recursive, unlike the `_temp/*` it replaces:
# that older pair of rules only covered direct children and one named
# sub-folder, so a new sub-folder was never ignored at all.
#
# ⚠️ A rule here does NOT untrack a file git is already following. Twelve of
# these were committed before the rules existed and stayed tracked for months
# despite them. If you add a path here, also run `git rm --cached <path>`.
# tests/test-no-tracked-scratch.js fails the build if anything under _temp/ is
# tracked again, because this comment on its own already failed to prevent it.
_temp/

